{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is your RPG lacking some adorable but perilous pixelated magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, look no further, TinyRPG - VFX Pack II will cover all your basic needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this pack one will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 26 Special Effects;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 8 Dark Spells;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 7 Bloody Spells;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 4 Monster Killer Attacks;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 3 Lupine Attacks;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 2 Poisonous Spells;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u25a0 2 Hit Effects;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match the effects to create stunning visuals, bringing back the might of the 90's JRPGs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*********\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Animations (26 sheets)\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0*********\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThis pack is for use in RPG Maker Series or the engine of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbOK to be used in Commercial projects made in RPG Maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou may modify some of the assets (but not redistribute them) for your own game use only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857500?t=1752714488","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857500?t=1752714488","capsule_image":"https://sha